#
# Test vectors for names.abnf: names, references, action strings and the
# canonical call text (ADR 0063; docs/design/call-language.md, "Name
# vectors").
#
# Each vector is one line: "ok", "err" or "errc", "@" and the rule it
# tests, a tab, then the text, with \t, \\, \" and \xHH escapes.
# "errc" marks text that matches the context-free grammar but breaks a
# constraint. Lines starting with "#", and empty lines, are ignored.

